{"data": [{"author_id": "2029887035750973440", "created_at": "2026-11-11T00:55:36.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120319497634734495"], "id": "2120319497634734495", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1669276256", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120085300185833878", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@op7418 这确实逆天了，随便打几个字就能作画了", "url": "https://x.com/laoxiongAI/status/2120319497634734495"}, {"author_id": "1987421060963442689", "created_at": "2026-11-10T23:19:32.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120295319862730922"], "id": "2120295319862730922", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1669276256", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 5, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120085300185833878", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@op7418 太有创意了 视觉效果绝佳", "url": "https://x.com/johnzhou123/status/2120295319862730922"}, {"author_id": "1769051162169561089", "created_at": "2026-11-10T21:08:54.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120262444979564851"], "id": "2120262444979564851", "in_reply_to_user_id": "372686608", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 8, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120260515205115933", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@cikibuilds @op7418 给模型留白比给提示词更难。流体墨字这种活，往往是它自己挑的方向比你想的更好看。", "url": "https://x.com/hajiMVP/status/2120262444979564851"}, {"author_id": "372686608", "created_at": "2026-11-10T21:01:14.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120260515205115933"], "id": "2120260515205115933", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1669276256", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 129, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120085300185833878", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@op7418 看到这条水墨很有共鸣。我让 Fable 5.2 给它自己做一支广告，风格让它自己定，它也选了水墨，还把大半张纸留空了。全片 740 行代码，没用生图和音乐模型。 https://t.co/6pUItyb36S", "url": "https://x.com/cikibuilds/status/2120260515205115933"}, {"author_id": "391180417", "created_at": "2026-11-10T19:06:52.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120231737930457572"], "id": "2120231737930457572", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1669276256", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 30, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120085300185833878", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@op7418 这对应的动画是预设的吧\n\n难道是动态生成就可怖了", "url": "https://x.com/DalinHuang/status/2120231737930457572"}, {"author_id": "2068767915285909504", "created_at": "2026-11-10T18:36:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120224108805816330"], "id": "2120224108805816330", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1669276256", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120085300185833878", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@op7418 没指定要做什么，它自己搞出带流体和音效的墨水字，这已经不是普通的“会画画”了。创意任务上这种主动性挺难得，我倒想知道你后来还改了几轮，还是第一稿就到这个完成度。", "url": "https://x.com/bhhb8668/status/2120224108805816330"}, {"author_id": "1689098925159149569", "created_at": "2026-11-10T18:03:35.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120215810782400521"], "id": "2120215810782400521", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1669276256", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120085300185833878", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@op7418 I tried Fable 5.2 for a similar project and it generated a 3D ink simulation with real-time fluid physics. The result was so detailed I had to pause the demo for 10 minutes just to watch the ink flow.", "url": "https://x.com/chengfu588728/status/2120215810782400521"}, {"author_id": "1955960758044647424", "created_at": "2026-11-10T18:01:32.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120215294727835947"], "id": "2120215294727835947", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1669276256", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120085300185833878", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@op7418 这太贵了", "url": "https://x.com/jinjiaodawang_z/status/2120215294727835947"}, {"author_id": "1682948050468188160", "created_at": "2026-11-10T17:15:29.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120203707438793023"], "id": "2120203707438793023", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1669276256", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 132, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120085300185833878", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@op7418 没指定做什么、只让它「体现自己的能力」，正好和把需求写死反着来：先看模型自己往哪走，挺适合摸清它的偏好。真要落地，大概还得再把范围收回来。水墨还能实时互动，这个选题本身就挺会挑。", "url": "https://x.com/zeraTlAO/status/2120203707438793023"}, {"author_id": "760516629541163008", "created_at": "2026-11-10T17:10:28.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120202443615252735"], "id": "2120202443615252735", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1669276256", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 18, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120085300185833878", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@op7418 很有古代那味儿～", "url": "https://x.com/rico_mary8192hy/status/2120202443615252735"}, {"author_id": "132120027", "created_at": "2026-11-10T16:49:45.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120197229210489193"], "id": "2120197229210489193", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1669276256", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 61, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120085300185833878", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@op7418 能自己想出打字变墨水，还配了音效，这个点子比画面本身更让人意外", "url": "https://x.com/danjinfr/status/2120197229210489193"}, {"author_id": "2109246029220700160", "created_at": "2026-11-10T16:48:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120196804050591924"], "id": "2120196804050591924", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1669276256", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 61, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120085300185833878", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@op7418 你是 claude 推荐给我的 x 创作者头头", "url": "https://x.com/X_GavinXu/status/2120196804050591924"}, {"author_id": "1589600083854913536", "created_at": "2026-11-10T16:27:22.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120191594930585660"], "id": "2120191594930585660", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1669276256", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 26, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120085300185833878", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@op7418 居然是中国水墨...", "url": "https://x.com/JellllyZheng/status/2120191594930585660"}, {"author_id": "1986748018943811585", "created_at": "2026-11-10T16:07:19.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120186550965457181"], "id": "2120186550965457181", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1669276256", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 33, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120085300185833878", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@op7418 无敌 Fable 5.2", "url": "https://x.com/xaiwind/status/2120186550965457181"}, {"author_id": "1132264353011384321", "created_at": "2026-11-10T15:31:42.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120177588497007032"], "id": "2120177588497007032", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1669276256", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 58, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120085300185833878", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@op7418 不给命题自由发挥还能做出这个，墨水还带音效，这审美有